#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:3
#: 1b952ab7a4394e2fa1b236aef2bd2dfb
msgid "磁矩旋转（Magmom Rotation）"
msgstr "Magnetic-Moment Rotation (Magmom Rotation)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:5
#: 6b4cce2d21c740efba2f017a14082cb4
msgid "**分类：** 扰动"
msgstr "**Category:** Perturbation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:7
#: 019596b538114299a30899f949af1ef4
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:9
#: 2ea78bdddcc240f0943e9675b750e2e5
msgid ""
"对已存在的磁矩做随机小角度旋转，并可选地扰动模长。每个输入结构输出多个旋转版"
"本，用于补充自旋方向附近的连续构型邻域数据。"
msgstr ""
"Apply random small-angle rotations to existing moments and optionally "
"perturb their magnitudes. Multiple variants per input provide continuous "
"local coverage around a reference spin direction."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:11
#: 8dcd233285db47cdbf653ad90ec89d4d
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:13
#: 89017f139ccc4006b3944799dd6f9cbb
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{m}'=\\lambda\\,\\mathbf{R}(\\hat{\\mathbf{n}},\\theta)\\,"
"\\mathbf{m},\\quad \\lambda\\in[f_{\\min},f_{\\max}]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:15
#: 2027af7d72c24f8fbb6334312c785023
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf R(\\hat{\\mathbf n},\\theta)$ 是绕单位轴 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 的三维"
"旋转矩阵， $\\theta$ 在零到最大旋转角之间抽样；$\\lambda$ 是可选的模长缩放。"
"只旋转方向时 $\\lambda=1$，所以 $|\\mathbf m'|=|\\mathbf m|$。"
msgstr "$\\mathbf R(\\hat{\\mathbf n},\\theta)$ is the three-dimensional rotation matrix about unit axis $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$. Sample $\\theta$ between zero and the maximum rotation angle; $\\lambda$ optionally scales the magnitude. For direction-only rotations, $\\lambda=1$, so $|\\mathbf m'|=|\\mathbf m|$."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:19
#: 4b865fae45784012bc6c34f1f1dcfe76
msgid ""
"**关键限制：** 这张卡只做随机旋转和模长缩放，不改变晶体结构，不定义新的磁序。"
"它依赖输入已有 `initial_magmoms`。"
msgstr ""
"**Scope:** This card only rotates and rescales moments. It neither changes "
"atomic geometry nor defines a new magnetic order, and it requires existing "
"`initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:21
#: 48196d833cdc466589e0b21a1eb49c40
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:23
#: 32ba1fcbce5e4763b33e933370c76d35
msgid "场景：模型在 MD 中遇到自旋方向涨落就崩"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: model errors rise sharply when spin directions fluctuate during MD"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:25
#: c831e44429e44b9c85c87240dd78c92a
msgid ""
"你训练了一个 NEP 磁性模型，所有训练数据里磁矩方向都是严格对齐的（FM 全同向、"
"AFM 严格翻转）。静态推理表现完美，但一跑有限温度 MD——原子磁矩受热涨落发生 "
"5~10 度的小角度偏转——力的误差直接翻倍。"
msgstr ""
"You trained a magnetic NEP model using only perfectly aligned moments: "
"parallel in FM states and exactly reversed in AFM states. Static predictions "
"are accurate, but in finite-temperature MD a 5–10° thermal deflection of "
"local moments doubles the force error."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:27
#: 771411794e484937a04b42ad684b7f10
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 训练集只覆盖了磁矩方向空间的离散点，模型在这些点之间只能外推。"
"需要在每个参考磁态周围加一批小角度旋转样本，让模型\"见过\"自旋在参考方向附近"
"连续变化的环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The training set covers only isolated points in moment-"
"direction space, forcing interpolation gaps to behave like extrapolation. "
"Add small-angle samples around each reference state so the model learns a "
"continuous neighborhood of spin orientations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:29
#: 65e42d8e907e408b8de72fde013ac264
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个已写入 `initial_magmoms` 的磁性结构（来自 `Magnetic Order` 或 "
"`Set Magnetic Moments` 的上游输出）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A magnetic structure with `initial_magmoms`, typically produced "
"by `Magnetic Order` or `Set Magnetic Moments`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:31
#: d7b5f2c8aa4144ce9097f86d8579fe9b
msgid ""
"**目标：** 对每个输入帧生成 5 个旋转版本，最大旋转角 10 度，模长扰动 ±5%，覆"
"盖自旋方向附近的连续邻域"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate five variants per input with rotations up to 10° and "
"magnitude scaling of ±5%, covering a local neighborhood around each "
"reference direction."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:33
#: 0c1d463267514e04984a0d40c1558a1c
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:34
#: cef1ce9c75894d5699ff1ba915e0ce53
msgid "`最大旋转角`（`max_angle`） = `10.0`"
msgstr "`Maximum rotation angle` (`max_angle`) = `10.0`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:35
#: bbc6b020376a4362b19d52ca8e0ad073
msgid "`生成结构数`（`num_structures`） = `5`"
msgstr "`Structures to generate` (`num_structures`) = `5`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:36
#: dd04b08fa5e9440b86438bde85664c1e
msgid ""
"`扰动磁矩大小`（`disturb_magnitude`） = 勾选，`磁矩缩放系数`"
"（`magnitude_factor`） = `[0.95, 1.05]`"
msgstr "Enable `Perturb moment magnitude` (`disturb_magnitude`) and set `Moment scaling factor` (`magnitude_factor`) to `[0.95, 1.05]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:38
#: d9b986d51f8a4f9dac6074ec19ba2ba4
msgid ""
"**输出：** 每输入帧 5 个结构，磁矩方向在 0~10 度范围内随机偏离，模长在 "
"95%~105% 之间浮动。原子位置不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Five structures per input. Moment directions are randomly "
"deflected by 0–10°, magnitudes are scaled to 95–105%, and atomic positions "
"are unchanged."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:40
#: bb4b93f4c5d34961a89ed66f4415933f
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:41
#: 52b274394b37498f9a11e83f7a340d0c
msgid "重训后跑有限温度 MD，检查力的 MAE 是否比之前更稳定"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, rerun the finite-temperature validation "
"and check whether force MAE remains stable under directional fluctuations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:42
#: 210f9329f6204fb5ab77c3e42f157db9
msgid ""
"如果仍有方向敏感性问题，增大 `最大旋转角`（`max_angle`）到 15~20 度，或增加 `"
"生成结构数`（`num_structures`）"
msgstr "If direction sensitivity remains, increase `Maximum rotation angle` (`max_angle`) to 15–20 degrees or increase `Structures to generate` (`num_structures`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:43
#: 0fb4d6976249434fb5d0c8ae3080b93f
msgid ""
"如果特定元素的磁矩扰动后偏离物理合理范围，用 `元素`（`elements`）限制只扰动目"
"标元素"
msgstr "If perturbations push a particular element's moments outside a physically reasonable range, use `Elements` (`elements`) to perturb only the target elements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:45
#: cfcda12c79e048f9b45da8a6b675b16e
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:47
#: 0537eef2ca044891851e72c11892012a
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:48
#: 3a61883a42964575a9294e51bcb1f97d
msgid "训练集只有固定方向的磁态，模型对方向涨落敏感"
msgstr ""
"The training set contains only fixed magnetic directions and the model is "
"sensitive to directional fluctuations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:49
#: 05931b15a9174daf8ff1b77c3a9c7f64
msgid "做有限温度 MD 或自旋动力学，需要连续的方向覆盖"
msgstr ""
"Finite-temperature MD or spin dynamics requires continuous directional "
"coverage."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:50
#: 4a3e247da8f648d19fbf8ef1d8e621fb
msgid "上游已有可信磁矩，只需在附近做小幅度采样"
msgstr ""
"The upstream moments are trusted and only local sampling around them is "
"needed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:52
#: 76e689cfdaa1449bb8decc43dc917a73
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:53
#: ffdd10e6bed54e918ed9ec17251381ac
msgid "输入没有初始磁矩 → 先用 `Set Magnetic Moments` 或 `Magnetic Order`"
msgstr ""
"The input has no moments → use `Set Magnetic Moments` or `Magnetic Order` "
"first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:54
#: cefc747f059349039912f6ff35e8717a
msgid "需要方向大范围覆盖（40°+）→ 用 `Small-Angle Spin Tilt` 确定性扫描"
msgstr ""
"You need broad angular coverage of 40° or more → use a deterministic `Small-"
"Angle Spin Tilt` scan."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:55
#: d47e92ff7f8549248226f52183c56279
msgid "只需要模长扰动不需要方向变化 → 这张卡的旋转功能白费了"
msgstr ""
"Only magnitude variation is needed → choose a workflow that does not "
"introduce unnecessary rotations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:57
#: fc53602abf7849ceb0431756659bd736
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:59
#: b7426e5123bd4bc492674eb2ad922232
msgid "元素（elements）"
msgstr "elements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:61
#: cc4f3abd672b4a02ab8e5c17fb6d25aa
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。逗号分隔的元素列表，如 `Fe,Co`——只对列出的元素做旋转和模长"
"扰动。留空则全部磁性原子参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Comma-separated symbols such as `Fe,Co`. Only listed "
"elements are rotated and rescaled; leave empty to include all atoms with "
"nonzero moments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:63
#: 54e0177f29264c518457f34e8f960e18
msgid "最大旋转角（max_angle）"
msgstr "max_angle"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:65
#: 86cda3ba46814fe5843e3416902e8c0b
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `10.0`。最大旋转角，单位度。每次随机采样角度在 [0, max_angle] "
"内均匀分布。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `10.0`. Maximum rotation angle in degrees. Each rotation "
"angle is sampled uniformly from `[0, max_angle]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:66
#: b2352e1cdb024e6b8a9a557661cf2194
msgid "保守：2~5°（验证方向变化确实有帮助）"
msgstr "Conservative: 2–5° (verify that directional augmentation is useful)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:67
#: e5866e0df5f749cf97af905532d49f95
msgid "平衡：8~15°（常规有限温度覆盖）"
msgstr "Balanced: 8–15° (routine finite-temperature coverage)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:68
#: 713d7728930543ddaf074797db4073db
msgid "探索：20°+（宽温度区间，需重点抽查）"
msgstr "Exploratory: 20° or more (broad angular coverage; inspect carefully)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:70
#: ad670ca3ac2544fdadd5ea19c6a8afc6
msgid "生成结构数（num_structures）"
msgstr "num_structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:72
#: 5d547b43dcfe4722b0f79c0decf3d5f3
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `5`。每输入帧输出的旋转版本数。5~10 用于轻量补样，10~30 常规覆"
"盖，30+ 建议后接过滤。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `5`. Number of rotated variants per input frame. Use 5–10 "
"for lightweight augmentation and 10–30 for routine coverage. For more than "
"30, follow with representative filtering."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:74
#: ef59459aef63443c8a488a633892a435
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:76
#: b52341c83bb14d6da73442f0c69fbe80
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是共线标量磁矩时，是否先沿 `轴`（`axis`）抬升为向量"
"再做旋转。输入是标量且需要旋转时必须开启。"
msgstr "`bool`, default `True`. For collinear scalar moments, whether to lift them along `Axis` (`axis`) into vectors before rotation. It must be enabled when scalar input needs rotation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:78
#: 8205c6c94188465cb04bd5f22d8d6422
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:80
#: faa23c10c4c54fb5b96230d380e04c47
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。`标量磁矩"
"转为矢量`（`lift_scalar`）抬升时使用的参考方向。输入已经是向量磁矩时此参数对"
"初始方向无影响。"
msgstr "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. Reference direction used when `Lift scalar moments to vectors` (`lift_scalar`) is enabled. It does not affect the initial direction when the input moments are already vectors."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:82
#: 86c720aecfad4609ab99c0f4a46e098e
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:84
#: 78d60c936a354beab67720edfb0fd9d9
msgid "扰动磁矩大小（disturb_magnitude）"
msgstr "disturb_magnitude"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:86
#: 8e4337b4c8894ce882dff23d4b295aa8
msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。旋转的同时随机缩放磁矩模长。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `True`. Randomly rescale moment magnitudes while rotating "
"them."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:88
#: cb54674fd2e449cb9139df58a6f221b8
msgid "磁矩缩放系数（magnitude_factor）"
msgstr "magnitude_factor"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:90
#: 9fc3ea92737a468ba35080d7cb939fd1
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(0.95, 1.05)`。`[min, max]` 格式的"
"模长缩放因子区间。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float]`, default: `(0.95, 1.05)`. Magnitude "
"scale-factor range expressed as `[minimum, maximum]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:91
#: d80d1f00566e486e9f688299157ad6f5
msgid "保守：`[0.98, 1.02]`"
msgstr "Conservative: `[0.98, 1.02]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:92
#: 5c124f19ff50464c949379662cdc77f1
msgid "平衡：`[0.95, 1.05]`"
msgstr "Balanced: `[0.95, 1.05]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:93
#: b84279246d3a401986a6a53ff7f9b9cf
msgid "探索：`[0.85, 1.15]`"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[0.85, 1.15]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:95
#: c85bd49a92ef4b33b147bb59ab723c9e
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:97
#: a0ad5ab2b4cc4edabe6024c113a05486
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `False`。勾选后固定种子可复现。对比实验时开，纯探索可以关。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `False`. Enable with a fixed seed for reproducibility. Use "
"it for controlled comparisons; leave it off during exploration."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:99
#: e2cfbb818b774b2689f1c1cac9e7bb7d
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:101
#: 0222b99f4a08473fb6251f60ec759e00
