msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:166
#: 22022643cf68460a847e79d2a3a6a367
msgid ""
"**输出和输入一样。** 检查输入是否有 `initial_magmoms`。标量磁矩需开 `标量磁矩"
"转为矢量`（`lift_scalar`）。`最大旋转角`（`max_angle`）不能为 0。"
msgstr "**The output is identical to the input.** Check that the input contains `initial_magmoms`. Scalar moments require `Lift scalar moments to vectors` (`lift_scalar`). `Maximum rotation angle` (`max_angle`) must not be 0."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:168
#: a9844947d9804ab49362b858aad58b91
msgid ""
"**输出磁矩全是零。** `元素`（`elements`）过滤掉了所有有磁矩的元素，或 `磁矩缩"
"放系数`（`magnitude_factor`）下限为 0 且被采样到。"
msgstr "**All output moments are zero.** `Elements` (`elements`) filtered out every element with a moment, or the lower bound of `Moment scaling factor` (`magnitude_factor`) was 0 and was sampled."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:170
#: 4adf8f99eab54ce0a1218d4d746789ac
msgid ""
"**每次运行结果不同。** 未开启 `Use Seed`。需要可复现时勾选并固定 `随机种子`"
"（`seed`）。"
msgstr "**Each run produces different results.** `Use Seed` is disabled. Enable it and fix `Random seed` (`seed`) for reproducibility."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:172
#: bc691a259b034e939b1b7b4ed826fca8
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

