msgstr "`MMR(a=10.0,s=0.95-1.05)`: vector rotation with magnitude perturbation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:175
#: edc7be2bd8c84e029cd40bfdd82d3455
