msgstr "See the parameter description for details."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:177
#: 6564d7aa82ed48e1b3bc9e3697f93a1a
msgid ""
"所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`；读取时优先使用 `spin`，没有时兼容旧 "
"`initial_magmoms`。"
msgstr ""
"All exported outputs use `spin:R:3`. Existing moments are read from `spin` "
"first, with legacy `initial_magmoms` accepted only when `spin` is absent."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:179
#: 1642b8eed0944c9e8a317eb2c2725c9f
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:181
#: a0d610cfdab7409da5a74608fea95a1c
msgid ""
"勾选 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`） + 固定 `随机种子`（`seed`） → 相同输入可复"
"现。每次旋转的随机轴和角度由 seed + 结构序号联合控制。"
msgstr "Enable `Use random seed` (`use_seed`) and fix `Random seed` (`seed`) to reproduce the same input. The random axis and angle for each rotation are controlled jointly by the seed and structure index."

#~ msgid "`Disturb Magnitude` = 勾选，`Magnitude Factor` = `[0.95, 1.05]`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `Disturb Magnitude` and set `Magnitude Factor` to `[0.95, 1.05]`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果仍有方向敏感性问题，增大 `Max Angle` 到 15~20 度，或增加 `Num "
#~ "Structures`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If directional sensitivity remains, increase `Max Angle` to 15–20° or "
#~ "increase `Num Structures`, then re-evaluate held-out angular slices."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果特定元素的磁矩扰动后偏离物理合理范围，用 `Elements` 限制只扰动目标元素"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If perturbing a particular species produces implausible moments, use "
#~ "`Elements` to restrict the operation to the intended magnetic sublattice."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是共线标量磁矩时，是否先沿 `Axis` 抬升为向量再做"
#~ "旋转。输入是标量且需要旋转时必须开启。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `True`. Lift collinear scalar moments to vectors along "
#~ "`Axis` before rotation. This must be enabled when scalar input is to be "
#~ "rotated."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。"
#~ "`lift_scalar` 抬升时使用的参考方向。输入已经是向量磁矩时此参数对初始方向无"
#~ "影响。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
#~ "Reference direction used by `lift_scalar`. It does not alter the initial "
#~ "direction of vector-valued input moments."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出和输入一样。** 检查输入是否有 `initial_magmoms`。标量磁矩需开 `Lift "
#~ "Scalar`。`Max Angle` 不能为 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The output is unchanged.** Confirm that the input has "
#~ "`initial_magmoms`, enable `Lift Scalar` for scalar moments, and ensure "
#~ "`Max Angle` is nonzero."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出磁矩全是零。** `Elements` 过滤掉了所有有磁矩的元素，或 `Magnitude "
#~ "Factor` 下限为 0 且被采样到。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**All output moments are zero.** `Elements` may exclude every magnetic "
#~ "species, or the magnitude-factor range may include zero. Correct the "
#~ "element scope and scaling interval."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**每次运行结果不同。** 未开启 `Use Seed`。需要可复现时勾选并固定 `Seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Results differ between runs.** Enable `Use Seed` and fix `Seed` for "
#~ "reproducibility."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。每次旋转的随机轴和角度由 "
#~ "seed + 结构序号联合控制。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce the same result for the "
#~ "same input. Each random axis and angle is determined jointly by the seed "
#~ "and structure index."

#~ msgid "所有输出写入 `initial_magmoms` 数组。"
#~ msgstr "All outputs are written to the `initial_magmoms` array."
